THIS LICENCE COVERS THE CODE ONLY.

The audio clips under clips/ are third-party recordings redistributed under
their own licences (CC BY, CC BY-SA, CC0, and public domain). Each clip's
source, host and licence are recorded in js/clips.js and shown to the player
on the reveal screen. Reusing a clip means honouring that clip's licence, not
this one. Clips marked kind: 'yt' are not redistributed at all — they stream
from YouTube and are never copied.
